        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kuno Becker, Macaulay Culkin, Eliza Dushku, Alexis Dziena\n- Works: Sex and Breakfast, Soñadoras, Goal!\n- Topics: Film, acting careers\n\nFacts:\n- Kuno Becker was born on January 14, 1978, and his full name is Eduardo Kuno Becker Paz.\n- Kuno Becker is a Mexican actor who has worked in telenovelas, Mexican cinema, and U.S. cinema.\n- Kuno Becker is best known for portraying Ruben Berrizabal in Soñadoras and Santiago Muñez in the football film Goal!.\n- Sex and Breakfast is a 2007 independent dark comedy film.\n- Sex and Breakfast stars Macaulay Culkin, Eliza Dushku, Alexis Dziena, and Kuno Becker.",
